WEBVTT

00:00:01.063 --> 00:00:10.263
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.073 --> 00:00:21.273
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.853 --> 00:00:30.753
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.253 --> 00:00:37.213
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:39.263
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.593 --> 00:00:43.553
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.303 --> 00:00:48.433
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.843 --> 00:00:52.643
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.313 --> 00:01:00.313
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.653 --> 00:01:08.993
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.863 --> 00:01:15.993
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.203 --> 00:01:21.473
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.573 --> 00:01:24.633
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:36.793 --> 00:01:41.523
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:41.993 --> 00:01:46.053
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:46.163 --> 00:01:49.133
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:49.463 --> 00:01:52.403
Cephiro had turned
into a world of terror...

00:01:52.733 --> 00:01:55.333
...under the rule
of High Priest Zagato.

00:02:02.643 --> 00:02:05.883
To become the Magic Knights
that will save Cephiro...

00:02:05.983 --> 00:02:10.013
...they must first acquire
an ore called escudo.

00:02:23.063 --> 00:02:27.163
Hikaru and company set forth
to the legendary Spring of Eterna...

00:02:27.273 --> 00:02:29.403
...in search of escudo.

00:02:29.773 --> 00:02:35.733
Ferio, the Mysterious
and Handsome Swordsman

00:03:07.813 --> 00:03:08.543
Puu

00:03:10.213 --> 00:03:12.153
This isn't a track meet!

00:03:17.153 --> 00:03:19.253
Which way should we go?

00:03:31.133 --> 00:03:32.103
Hikaru!

00:03:56.093 --> 00:03:57.493
I did it!

00:03:57.593 --> 00:03:58.633
I am glad you are safe!

00:03:58.633 --> 00:04:00.533
I am glad you are safe!
You're so amazing!

00:04:01.333 --> 00:04:02.663
Hey, Mokona!

00:04:03.063 --> 00:04:05.663
Why are you heading
toward the monsters?

00:04:07.273 --> 00:04:09.333
I think it's a coincidence, Umi.

00:04:09.443 --> 00:04:11.533
I'll be upset if it isn't!

00:04:11.873 --> 00:04:14.313
If it gives us weird directions again...

00:04:20.783 --> 00:04:22.013
Another monster!

00:04:34.303 --> 00:04:36.893
This may not be a coincidence.

00:04:37.003 --> 00:04:40.303
The monsters may be
situated on the path to Eterna.

00:04:40.403 --> 00:04:42.803
Don't say ominous things like that.

00:04:46.473 --> 00:04:47.443
What?

00:04:48.513 --> 00:04:51.813
It may just be me,
but I feel like someone's watching.

00:04:52.113 --> 00:04:54.083
Don't scare me like that.

00:04:54.723 --> 00:04:59.183
In any case, it might be wiser for us
to have our weapons in hand as well.

00:04:59.293 --> 00:05:01.783
We do not know when
the next monster will strike.

00:05:02.393 --> 00:05:03.863
I guess so...

00:05:05.163 --> 00:05:06.593
W-What's this?

00:05:10.003 --> 00:05:12.433
Umi and Fuu, your weapons! Hurry!

00:05:27.123 --> 00:05:28.553
Help us!

00:05:31.323 --> 00:05:32.753
Umi! Fuu!

00:05:47.673 --> 00:05:48.603
Mokona!

00:05:58.153 --> 00:06:00.083
Thanks for helping us.

00:06:00.583 --> 00:06:02.413
Who are you guys?

00:06:02.923 --> 00:06:04.683
I'm Hikaru Shidou.

00:06:05.593 --> 00:06:07.523
I am Fuu Hououji.

00:06:08.093 --> 00:06:09.893
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki.

00:06:10.563 --> 00:06:11.823
I'm Ferio.

00:06:12.263 --> 00:06:15.353
In any case,
you guys are pretty careless.

00:06:15.463 --> 00:06:18.803
Walking around in the Forest
of Silence without weapons.

00:06:20.473 --> 00:06:23.463
That's like asking to be killed.

00:06:23.573 --> 00:06:26.373
Why is it careless
to walk without weapons?

00:06:26.473 --> 00:06:29.773
The Forest of Silence
is home to many monsters.

00:06:30.583 --> 00:06:33.913
There are hundreds of thousands
of monsters roaming about.

00:06:34.023 --> 00:06:35.783
Hundreds of thousands?

00:06:36.253 --> 00:06:39.023
Anyway,
want to hire me as an escort?

00:06:39.123 --> 00:06:43.023
It's impossible for you guys to get
out of this place by yourselves.

00:06:43.123 --> 00:06:46.723
I work in this forest as a hunter.
You've seen how well I work.

00:06:47.833 --> 00:06:50.063
I think I'd come in handy.

00:06:50.173 --> 00:06:55.073
Sorry, but we can't hire you. We don't
have any of this country's money.

00:06:55.173 --> 00:06:57.103
Oh, food will do.

00:06:57.643 --> 00:07:00.443
I haven't eaten anything
sensible in a while.

00:07:00.543 --> 00:07:02.703
You're okay with food, but...

00:07:13.023 --> 00:07:14.393
Amazing!

00:07:14.693 --> 00:07:16.163
Good for you!

00:07:16.263 --> 00:07:18.953
This is
a wonderful talent, Sir Mokona!

00:07:20.833 --> 00:07:21.633
Burp

00:07:22.163 --> 00:07:23.993
I guess we have a deal.

00:07:26.273 --> 00:07:29.263
What are you thinking,
trusting him so easily?

00:07:29.373 --> 00:07:32.433
What if he is somehow
related to Zagato?

00:07:33.313 --> 00:07:35.113
But he saved us.

00:07:35.213 --> 00:07:38.483
It might be a trick
to catch us off guard.

00:07:41.753 --> 00:07:43.983
There is no need to escort us.

00:07:44.093 --> 00:07:47.083
We will give you
the food, so please leave.

00:07:47.193 --> 00:07:50.453
To think that such a beauty
walks around without an escort.

00:07:50.563 --> 00:07:51.533
Beauty?

00:07:53.133 --> 00:07:56.723
It's too dangerous for a beauty
to walk through this forest unescorted.

00:07:58.503 --> 00:07:59.803
A beauty...

00:08:00.403 --> 00:08:01.393
Such...

00:08:01.943 --> 00:08:03.433
...truth!

00:08:04.013 --> 00:08:06.373
Fuu, can we hire this guy?

00:08:07.783 --> 00:08:09.113
Mr. Ferio.

00:08:09.213 --> 00:08:12.653
You claim to be a hunter,
but if you truly were...

00:08:13.453 --> 00:08:17.943
Is it not strange to be hunting in the
monster-infested Forest of Silence?

00:08:22.423 --> 00:08:25.123
You found me out.
Right, I'm no hunter.

00:08:25.233 --> 00:08:26.783
I'm a swordsman.

00:08:26.903 --> 00:08:31.633
I tried to give Cephiro's current
ruler, Zagato, a piece of my mind.

00:08:31.733 --> 00:08:35.463
I almost got caught instead,
and I escaped into these woods.

00:08:35.573 --> 00:08:37.633
But I don't know the way out.

00:08:37.743 --> 00:08:39.573
An interesting story.

00:08:39.673 --> 00:08:43.773
The previous tale is a lie,
and this one is the truth.

00:08:43.883 --> 00:08:46.313
But is that really the case?

00:08:46.313 --> 00:08:48.713
You got me beat. I give up.

00:08:48.823 --> 00:08:51.083
That is a wise decision.

00:08:59.763 --> 00:09:01.523
He's still following us.

00:09:01.633 --> 00:09:03.723
He really doesn't know the way out.

00:09:03.833 --> 00:09:07.893
Or he could have another goal. Like
abducting the resourceful Mokona.

00:09:08.003 --> 00:09:08.973
That can't be!

00:09:08.973 --> 00:09:10.633
That can't be!
Let's throw him off.

00:09:20.013 --> 00:09:22.283
What are you guys doing?
Hide-and-seek?

00:09:26.353 --> 00:09:28.053
We need sleep for tomorrow.

00:09:28.163 --> 00:09:31.923
Sleep? How can we in
the middle of the wilderness?

00:09:32.033 --> 00:09:33.583
We'll have to camp out.

00:09:33.703 --> 00:09:34.633
Must we?

00:09:34.633 --> 00:09:36.263
Must we?
Then what'll we do?

00:09:42.843 --> 00:09:44.813
You're amazing, Mokona!

00:09:46.113 --> 00:09:50.103
Like Presea said,
everything you need for a journey.

00:09:51.883 --> 00:09:52.583
My...

00:09:52.583 --> 00:09:54.243
My...
Wow!

00:09:56.683 --> 00:09:59.523
Pajamas too...
Anything we can think of...

00:09:59.623 --> 00:10:01.383
Is this a hotel?

00:10:02.963 --> 00:10:05.823
Fuu, can I take some food to Ferio?

00:10:06.233 --> 00:10:08.823
He doesn't seem
like such a bad guy...

00:10:10.233 --> 00:10:12.363
You are kind, Ms. Hikaru.

00:10:13.003 --> 00:10:14.133
All right.

00:10:14.243 --> 00:10:15.103
Really?

00:10:15.173 --> 00:10:19.273
However, I will take it to him.
It is because you are too kind.

00:10:19.373 --> 00:10:23.313
I fear you will invite him inside this
tent instead of taking food to him.

00:10:23.413 --> 00:10:25.383
I can see that. Yup!

00:10:34.863 --> 00:10:36.823
I have brought some food.

00:10:36.923 --> 00:10:39.293
I will leave it here, so please eat.

00:10:39.393 --> 00:10:40.363
Wait.

00:10:40.803 --> 00:10:42.233
Is there anything else?

00:10:42.333 --> 00:10:45.203
Can you... keep me
company for a while?

00:10:45.303 --> 00:10:47.233
What nonsense is that?

00:10:47.903 --> 00:10:49.963
I don't want to eat alone.

00:10:52.443 --> 00:10:54.703
Just until I'm done eating.

00:10:55.643 --> 00:10:58.413
I just want some company for a while.

00:10:58.653 --> 00:10:59.673
Ferio...

00:11:00.883 --> 00:11:04.113
Even someone who's always grumpy
like you is better than nobody.

00:11:46.363 --> 00:11:48.803
Mokona, what's going on here?

00:11:48.903 --> 00:11:51.663
The further we go,
the more monsters we bump into!

00:11:53.773 --> 00:11:56.603
Make it a path with
no monsters this time!

00:12:17.693 --> 00:12:20.633
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:31.413 --> 00:12:32.503
No way...

00:12:32.613 --> 00:12:34.273
W-Wait! Stop!

00:12:35.083 --> 00:12:37.703
You don't want us
to go through that, do you?

00:12:37.813 --> 00:12:40.143
That's crazy!
We may have weapons...

00:12:40.253 --> 00:12:43.483
...but there's no way
we can fight that many monsters!

00:12:44.593 --> 00:12:45.883
What now?

00:12:45.993 --> 00:12:47.853
We'll have to go back...

00:12:47.963 --> 00:12:49.893
No, let's consult Ferio.

00:12:50.433 --> 00:12:51.693
Ms. Hikaru.

00:12:53.193 --> 00:12:58.003
Clef told us that Cephiro became
a land where monsters roam.

00:12:58.573 --> 00:13:01.193
But this place
is more than that. I feel it.

00:13:01.303 --> 00:13:03.743
It is dangerous to trust that man.

00:13:04.713 --> 00:13:07.173
He has not
spoken a word of truth.

00:13:07.283 --> 00:13:09.403
Clef and Presea aren't here.

00:13:09.513 --> 00:13:12.073
Ferio's the only one with
knowledge of the Forest of Silence.

00:13:12.883 --> 00:13:14.313
Exactly!

00:13:14.423 --> 00:13:15.473
Ferio!

00:13:15.583 --> 00:13:18.213
Looks like I'm finally
gonna be of use.

00:13:21.893 --> 00:13:24.523
I'll answer all your
questions if you want.

00:13:24.633 --> 00:13:27.253
Ferio, what's going on in this forest?

00:13:27.363 --> 00:13:30.523
Was this a normal forest
before Zagato took over?

00:13:30.633 --> 00:13:34.933
No. Zagato's reign hasn't changed
this place from what it was before.

00:13:35.473 --> 00:13:38.913
Magic never worked,
and monsters always roamed about.

00:13:39.013 --> 00:13:42.843
That's why even Zagato couldn't
do anything about this place.

00:13:42.943 --> 00:13:46.243
It looks like that rock
is the reason for all this.

00:13:46.353 --> 00:13:49.943
It attracts evil
and makes it even more hideous.

00:14:00.263 --> 00:14:03.253
The monsters might go
away if we break that rock!

00:14:03.363 --> 00:14:04.963
You've got to be kidding!

00:14:05.073 --> 00:14:09.473
We'd have to plunge into those
monsters. They'd kill us in no time!

00:14:09.943 --> 00:14:13.813
So we'll split into two groups. One
will divert the monsters' attention...

00:14:13.913 --> 00:14:16.043
...and the other will destroy the rock.

00:14:16.143 --> 00:14:18.583
That means we have
to fight monsters again?

00:14:18.683 --> 00:14:20.773
That's impossible for the three of us!

00:14:21.083 --> 00:14:22.053
But...

00:14:22.153 --> 00:14:24.623
Let me divert the monsters' attention.

00:14:25.053 --> 00:14:25.923
No.

00:14:26.023 --> 00:14:30.863
If we can't even do this, we probably
won't be able to save Cephiro either.

00:14:31.463 --> 00:14:35.093
You mentioned Clef earlier...
Did you mean Master Mage Clef?

00:14:35.203 --> 00:14:36.563
That's right.

00:14:36.863 --> 00:14:39.703
Master Mage Clef,
in order to save us...

00:14:40.303 --> 00:14:42.503
You should not trust him just yet.

00:14:42.843 --> 00:14:43.963
I see.

00:14:45.113 --> 00:14:47.573
You're thinking about
rescuing Princess Emeraude...

00:14:47.683 --> 00:14:49.613
...and saving Cephiro?

00:14:51.683 --> 00:14:54.913
I'm doing the same.
I want to rescue Princess Emeraude.

00:14:55.223 --> 00:14:56.343
What?

00:14:57.123 --> 00:15:00.823
I was a traveling bard.
I don't have any parents.

00:15:01.193 --> 00:15:04.723
My first memory is of my master
teaching me to perform tricks.

00:15:04.833 --> 00:15:07.763
And one day,
I was invited to the castle.

00:15:09.633 --> 00:15:13.933
I walked around the castle on
my own, but not to steal anything.

00:15:14.043 --> 00:15:16.473
Everything was just so unusual.

00:15:29.083 --> 00:15:32.083
It was
Princess Emeraude who saved me.

00:15:33.123 --> 00:15:36.353
That is something
that I gave to him as a gift.

00:15:36.463 --> 00:15:38.393
It was not stolen.

00:15:39.293 --> 00:15:41.733
Princess Emeraude saved my life.

00:15:43.103 --> 00:15:45.863
I'll do anything
to defeat Zagato and save her!

00:15:46.933 --> 00:15:48.993
Just kidding. Did you believe me?

00:15:49.103 --> 00:15:51.573
You're horrible! You lied to us!

00:15:51.713 --> 00:15:55.643
I want to get out of this forest.
But I can't find my way out.

00:15:56.083 --> 00:15:58.553
So I have to tag along with you.

00:15:58.653 --> 00:16:00.673
All right, let's have him help.

00:16:00.783 --> 00:16:05.843
Umi and I will get the monsters away.
Fuu and Ferio will destroy the rock.

00:16:05.993 --> 00:16:07.393
All right, gotcha.

00:16:07.493 --> 00:16:08.463
Let's go, Umi!

00:16:08.463 --> 00:16:09.753
Let's go, Umi!
Y-Yeah.

00:16:15.503 --> 00:16:18.433
Um, is the story
you just told the truth?

00:16:19.933 --> 00:16:23.393
Which is the truth?
Pick the one you like.

00:16:36.923 --> 00:16:37.883
Umi!

00:17:08.283 --> 00:17:09.773
Now. Let's go!

00:17:09.883 --> 00:17:11.083
R-Right!

00:17:14.663 --> 00:17:17.653
I'll take care of this myself.
You stand back and wait!

00:17:17.763 --> 00:17:19.323
I cannot do that.

00:17:47.223 --> 00:17:49.123
What is this force?

00:17:54.703 --> 00:17:55.563
What is wrong?

00:17:55.563 --> 00:17:56.793
What is wrong?
Stay back!

00:17:59.303 --> 00:18:00.673
Don't come near me!

00:18:11.413 --> 00:18:13.853
This is one crazy rock...

00:18:17.523 --> 00:18:20.393
That rock doesn't
only attract monsters.

00:18:20.493 --> 00:18:22.623
It turns creatures into monsters!

00:18:22.723 --> 00:18:24.663
That's why this forest...

00:18:30.973 --> 00:18:31.993
Ferio!

00:18:32.833 --> 00:18:33.933
Stay back!

00:18:34.033 --> 00:18:36.663
You have to break
the rock with an arrow!

00:18:37.373 --> 00:18:40.603
Impossible! The rock
is a hundred meters away!

00:18:40.713 --> 00:18:42.543
I cannot break it with an arrow!

00:18:43.043 --> 00:18:44.103
Listen.

00:18:44.213 --> 00:18:47.043
Cephiro is a land of will!

00:18:47.483 --> 00:18:51.323
If you believe, the arrow
will fly, and the rock will break!

00:18:52.793 --> 00:18:56.663
If I believe, the arrow will fly,
and the rock will break.

00:19:05.903 --> 00:19:07.093
I cannot...

00:19:07.203 --> 00:19:09.533
Don't doubt! Believe in yourself!

00:19:24.023 --> 00:19:25.423
Hurry and shoot!

00:19:26.793 --> 00:19:28.223
If I believe...

00:19:28.823 --> 00:19:30.053
...it will happen.

00:19:46.173 --> 00:19:47.713
We can't do this anymore!

00:19:47.713 --> 00:19:49.473
We can't do this anymore!
Do your best, Umi!

00:20:08.033 --> 00:20:09.123
H-Huh?

00:20:09.663 --> 00:20:11.153
W-What's going on?

00:20:11.233 --> 00:20:12.203
Dunno.

00:20:17.973 --> 00:20:20.133
Fuu and Ferio did it!

00:20:24.453 --> 00:20:25.843
Ferio! Ferio!

00:20:40.333 --> 00:20:42.893
Looks like you
have a long way to go...

00:20:43.003 --> 00:20:45.093
...if you can't break a rock.

00:20:45.573 --> 00:20:48.833
I assume you are
all right from that remark.

00:20:56.943 --> 00:21:00.473
I thought Ferio was going
to come with us to Eterna...

00:21:01.083 --> 00:21:04.613
I was only looking for a way
out of the Forest of Silence.

00:21:04.723 --> 00:21:07.483
It should be obvious
that we part here.

00:21:21.173 --> 00:21:23.433
I want you to have this.

00:21:29.483 --> 00:21:32.273
Make a wish.
I'm sure this will grant it.

00:21:32.383 --> 00:21:34.853
Why is there only a gift for Fuu?

00:21:36.053 --> 00:21:39.043
It's a difference in how
much I care, of course!

00:21:45.793 --> 00:21:46.593
Fuu?

00:21:49.863 --> 00:21:53.773
My lord, the Forest of Silence
has appeared in the Water Mirror.

00:21:53.873 --> 00:21:56.133
How did this happen?

00:22:05.653 --> 00:22:07.943
They are still alive...

00:22:25.803 --> 00:22:30.203
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:31.773 --> 00:22:37.373
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:38.813 --> 00:22:44.383
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:45.123 --> 00:22:48.953
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:51.263 --> 00:22:54.423
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:54.633 --> 00:22:57.063
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:58.173 --> 00:23:01.973
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.003 --> 00:23:09.643
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:10.383 --> 00:23:15.643
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:16.023 --> 00:23:22.823
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:23.323 --> 00:23:28.763
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:44.283 --> 00:23:46.303
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:46.783 --> 00:23:50.053
We finally escaped
from the Forest of Silence.

00:23:50.623 --> 00:23:54.113
But there, we found
Alcyone waiting for us.

00:23:55.323 --> 00:23:59.223
Umi fell, wounded by
the storm of spells from Alcyone...

00:23:59.333 --> 00:24:02.193
...and danger crept upon
Fuu and myself as well!

00:24:02.303 --> 00:24:04.363
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:04.773 --> 00:24:07.293
Alcyone, the Vengeful Sorceress.

00:24:07.403 --> 00:24:08.403
Alcyone, the Vengeful Sorceress

00:24:08.403 --> 00:24:10.373
Alcyone, the Vengeful Sorceress
You have to watch it!

00:24:10.373 --> 00:24:11.413
Alcyone, the Vengeful Sorceress

00:24:11.413 --> 00:24:18.333
